  "id": "public-speaking-anxiety",
  "term": "public-speaking anxiety",
  "definition": "Public-speaking anxiety is fear or distress linked to speaking in front of an audience. It can involve worries about one’s own reactions during a speech, how the audience will respond, or being judged negatively.",
